From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheKit <thekit@disroot.org>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 03:46:11 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] WayDroidService: Push task lifecycle to the window HAL

Forward taskCreated/removed/focusChanged from the task stack
listener to vendor.waydroid.window@1.3 so the hwcomposer keeps an
authoritative task table instead of inferring lifecycle from layer
names. The HAL restarts with the framework (and on its own crashes),
so the full task table is resynced every time its service
(re)registers with hwservicemanager.

Change-Id: I1c2b86d3b98bd3fadc7d266521870f848cbfd5ba
---
 Android.bp                                    |   2 +
 .../platform/internal/WayDroidService.java    | 148 +++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 149 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

